<programme start="20261019004200 +0000" stop="20261019014100 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wildlife Icons</title><sub-title lang="en">Springbok &amp; Impala: Life in the Herd</sub-title><desc lang="en">Africa&apos;s charismatic megafauna receive a lot of attention, but the antelope have rich stories filled with daily struggles of survival; two antelope species, springbok and impala, outnumber all the others and play critical roles in the circle of life.</desc><credits><director>Marius Burger</director><actor>Jack Spencer</actor></credits><date>20220522</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/018c20658f3e2e9ebe6e2758458c6cc3.jpeg"/></programme>
