<programme start="20261019063500 +0000" stop="20261019073300 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Hippo Supremacy</title><sub-title lang="en">The Hippo Supremacy</sub-title><desc lang="en">Explore the harsh realities that shape hippo life on Zambia&apos;s Luangwa River; meet a bull who serves as river master, a mother determined to protect her newborn calf and ancient rivals who fight to the death as the dry season reaches its apex.</desc><credits><director>Mark Rapaport</director><actor>Kimball Farley</actor><actor>Lilla Kizlinger</actor><actor>Eliza Roberts</actor></credits><date>20160709</date><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/775974a57a6ed461e07e702ceee1cd94.jpeg"/></programme>
