<programme start="20261018110000 +0000" stop="20261018130000 +0000" channel="SN360 🇨🇦"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Ottawa Senators at Philadelphia Flyers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Philadelphia Flyers host the Ottawa Senators for an Eastern Conference showdown at Xfinity Mobile Arena. Ottawa&apos;s Tim Stutzle leads the team in points, goals and assists, while Philadelphia&apos;s Travis Konecny leads in points and assists.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
